(text "USB 2.0 peripheral to rear hub port 2. CM4 eMMC is programmed via this link with RPIBOOT grounded.\nVBUS is sensing only. 22k / 33k divider keeps GPIO24 below 3.3V at 5.25V VBUS.\nNever connect the PC VBUS to the CM4 5V power rail." (at 15 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid c23e0b03-7b3e-4eb6-bfec-3cede5a14722))
